### 6-4. Drive Stiffness 설정 (Stop 상태에서 실행)

```python
from pxr import UsdPhysics, Usd
import omni.usd

stage = omni.usd.get_context().get_stage()
UR10_JOINTS = [
    "shoulder_pan_joint", "shoulder_lift_joint", "elbow_joint",
    "wrist_1_joint", "wrist_2_joint", "wrist_3_joint",
]
